#. type: Title ##
#: src/content/docs/download.md src/content/docs/release-notes/0-9-4-beta.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Unattended installation"
msgstr "Installaziun senza surveglianza"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#: src/content/docs/release-notes/0-9-4-beta.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Unprivileged user namespaces are restricted per executable rather than being disabled, installation can run unattended from an answer file, and every package build is published for anyone to check."
msgstr "Ils spazis da num da l’utilisader senza privilegis vegnan restrenschids per program exequibel empè d’esser deactivads, l’installaziun po vegnir exequida senza surveglianza cun ina datoteca da respostas, e mintga build da pachets vegn publitgà e po vegnir controllà da mintga persuna."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: src/content/docs/release-notes/0-9-4-beta.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "0.9.4 Beta release notes"
msgstr "Remartgas davart la versiun 0.9.4 Beta"

#. type: Title ##
#: src/content/docs/release-notes/0-9-4-beta.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Unprivileged user namespaces: restricted, not switched off"
msgstr "Spazis da num da l’utilisader senza privilegis: restrenschids, betg deactivads"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/release-notes/0-9-4-beta.md
msgid ""
"Arch removed `bubblewrap-suid` in September 2026. Ditana had relied on it to "
"keep sandboxes working while unprivileged user namespaces stayed switched "
"off, so its removal broke both halves of that setup simultaneously – and "
"since the installer fetches its configuration at runtime, it broke "
"installations from the already released 0.9.3 medium as well, not just those "
"newly created."
msgstr ""
"Arch ha allontanà `bubblewrap-suid` il settember 2026. Ditana sa basava sin "
"quest pachet per mantegnair ils sandbox en funcziun, durant ch’ils spazis da "
"num da l’utilisader senza privilegis restavan deactivads; perquai ha "
"l’allontanament dal pachet donnegià omaduas mesadads da quest arranschament "
"a medem temp – e perquai che l’installatur telechargia sia configuraziun "
"durant l’execuziun, ha quai er donnegià las installaziuns cun il medium da "
"la versiun 0.9.3 ch’era gia publitgà, betg mo las installaziuns novas."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/release-notes/0-9-4-beta.md
msgid ""
"There was no replacement to move to. Upstream removed setuid support in "
"bubblewrap 0.12.0, one day after 0.11.2 fixed CVE-2026-41163, a privilege "
"escalation that existed solely in that mode, and the 0.11.x branch that was "
"made available to whoever still needed it was never adopted by anyone."
msgstr ""
"I na deva nagin remplazzament, al qual ins avess pudì midar. Il project "
"d’origin ha allontanà il sustegn da setuid en bubblewrap 0.12.0, in di "
"suenter che 0.11.2 aveva curregì CVE-2026-41163, in’escalaziun da privilegis "
"ch’existiva mo en quest modus, ed il rom 0.11.x ch’era vegnì mess a "
"disposiziun per tgi che duvrava anc el, n’è mai vegnì surpiglià da nagin."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/release-notes/0-9-4-beta.md
msgid ""
"So the arrangement is now reversed. Rather than disabling user namespaces "
"for all and making one binary exempt, Ditana allows them on a per-executable "
"basis. A BPF program attached to the kernel's `userns_create` hook refuses a "
"namespace to anything that has not been declared, and the declaration sits "
"in the configuration next to the package that needs it:"
msgstr ""
"Perquai è l’arranschament uss invertì. Empè da deactivar ils spazis da num "
"da l’utilisader per tut ils programs e da far in’excepziun per ina datoteca "
"binara, permetta Ditana ils spazis da num per program exequibel. In program "
"BPF collià cun il hook `userns_create` dal kernel refusa in spazi da num a "
"tut quai che n’è betg vegnì declerà, e la decleraziun sa chatta en la "
"configuraziun sper il pachet che dovra il spazi da num:"

#. type: Fenced code block (kdl)
#: src/content/docs/release-notes/0-9-4-beta.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"- name=\"flatpak\" default-value=#true {\n"
"    arch-packages \"flatpak\"\n"
"    userns-allow \"/usr/bin/bwrap\"\n"
"  }\n"
msgstr ""
"- name=\"flatpak\" default-value=#true {\n"
"    arch-packages \"flatpak\"\n"
"    userns-allow \"/usr/bin/bwrap\"\n"
"  }\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/release-notes/0-9-4-beta.md
msgid ""
"An essential point, since it determines the outcome in case of errors: a "
"hook of this kind can only ever refuse, never grant. The sysctl that "
"previously disabled user namespaces must be raised for the guard to have "
"anything to act upon, and it is raised only by the service that has already "
"loaded and attached the program. A machine that cannot load it keeps user "
"namespaces entirely switched off. The failure forfeits your sandboxes but "
"never your protection."
msgstr ""
"In punct essenzial, perquai ch’el decida tge che capita en cas d’errurs: in "
"hook da quest tip po mo refusar, mai permetter. Il sysctl che deactivava fin "
"qua ils spazis da num da l’utilisader sto vegnir augmentà, per ch’il "
"guardian haja insumma insatge da far, ed el vegn augmentà mo dal servetsch "
"che ha gia chargià e collià il program. Ina maschina che na po betg chargiar "
"il program tegna ils spazis da num da l’utilisader deactivads dal tuttafatg. "
"Cun l’errur perdais Vus Voss sandbox, ma mai Vossa protecziun."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/release-notes/0-9-4-beta.md
msgid ""
"The guard is a separate package, [ditana-userns-guard](https://github.com/"
"acrion/ditana-userns-guard), installed together with the **System "
"Hardening** option that used to be called \"Disable unprivileged user "
"namespaces\"."
msgstr ""
"Il guardian è in pachet separà, [ditana-userns-guard](https://github.com/"
"acrion/ditana-userns-guard), che vegn installà ensemen cun l’opziun **System "
"Hardening** che sa numnava pli baud «Disable unprivileged user namespaces»."

#. type: Title ##
#: src/content/docs/release-notes/0-9-4-beta.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "LibreWolf now comes from Arch"
msgstr "LibreWolf deriva uss dad Arch"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/release-notes/0-9-4-beta.md
msgid ""
"LibreWolf now comes from the Arch repositories rather than from Flathub, "
"adhering to the preference hierarchy that puts a native package first. Brave "
"continues to be available via the AUR; the rationale is detailed on the [AUR "
"vs Flatpak](/best-practices/aur-vs-flatpak/) page."
msgstr ""
"LibreWolf deriva uss dals repositoris dad Arch e betg pli da Flathub, tenor "
"l’urden da preferenzas che metta in pachet nativ a l’emprim lieu. Brave "
"resta disponibel via l’AUR; la motivaziun è explitgada detagliadamain sin la "
"pagina [AUR u Flatpak](/best-practices/aur-vs-flatpak/)."

#. type: Title ##
#: src/content/docs/release-notes/0-9-4-beta.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Every sysctl value is declared as data"
msgstr "Mintga valur sysctl vegn declerada sco datas"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/release-notes/0-9-4-beta.md
msgid ""
"Every sysctl value the installer writes is now declared as data rather than "
"assembled as shell text. Two settings that write the same key with different "
"values stop the installation and are both named. Previously, both lines were "
"written and the last one silently won."
msgstr ""
"Mintga valur sysctl che l’installatur scriva vegn uss declerada sco datas "
"empè da vegnir cumponida sco text da shell. Dus parameters che scrivan la "
"medema clav cun valurs differentas ferman l’installaziun e vegnan numnads "
"omadus. Pli baud vegnivan scrittas omaduas lingias, e l’ultima prevaleva "
"tacitamain."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/release-notes/0-9-4-beta.md
msgid ""
"An installation can now run with nobody present at the keyboard. An answer "
"file pre-supplies what the installer would normally request, and it appears "
"on a small config drive that the installer discovers independently – the "
"identical setup a hosting provider would use to set Ditana up over PXE. No "
"keystrokes are simulated anywhere: the mechanism is the installer reading "
"its answers rather than soliciting them, which is why it works for a "
"provider and not just for a test."
msgstr ""
"In’installaziun po uss vegnir exequida senza ch’insatgi saja davant la "
"tastatura. Ina datoteca da respostas furnescha ordavant quai che "
"l’installatur dumandass normalmain, ed ella sa chatta sin in pitschen disc "
"da configuraziun che l’installatur chatta sez – il medem arranschament ch’in "
"purschider da hosting utilisass per installar Ditana via PXE. Nagliur na "
"vegnan simuladas tastas: il mecanissem consista en il fatg che l’installatur "
"legia sias respostas empè da dumandar quellas, e perquai funcziuna el per in "
"purschider e betg mo per in test."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/release-notes/0-9-4-beta.md
msgid ""
"The account password is taken from the answer file as a hash, never in the "
"clear. An example file is available in the installer repository, and the "
"mechanism is documented there in full."
msgstr ""
"Il pled-clav da l’account vegn prendì da la datoteca da respostas sco hash, "
"mai sco text betg criptà. Ina datoteca d’exempel è disponibla en il "
"repositori da l’installatur, ed il mecanissem è documentà là cumplettamain."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/release-notes/0-9-4-beta.md
msgid ""
"An answer that cannot take effect stops the installation instead of being "
"dropped in silence: a setting this machine does not offer, and one that a "
"default expression would overwrite again, are both refused by name, together "
"with the condition that makes them impossible. And because nobody is "
"watching the screen, a run that stops writes its cause to the first serial "
"port, every line carrying the marker `DITANA-AUTOINSTALL-ABORT:`, so that a "
"provisioning system reading the console learns the reason while the machine "
"is still up rather than waiting out a silence. Where the console is "
"elsewhere, the kernel command line names it."
msgstr ""
"Ina resposta che na po betg avair effect ferma l’installaziun empè da vegnir "
"ignorada tacitamain: in parameter che questa maschina na porscha betg ed in "
"parameter ch’in’expressiun da standard remplazzass puspè vegnan omadus "
"refusads cun lur num, ensemen cun la cundiziun che renda quels impussibels. "
"E perquai che nagin na guarda il visur, scriva in’execuziun ch’è sa fermada "
"la raschun sin l’emprim port serial, mintga lingia cun la marcaziun `DITANA-"
"AUTOINSTALL-ABORT:`, uschia ch’in sistem da provisioning che legia la "
"consola vegn a savair la raschun durant che la maschina è anc en funcziun, "
"empè da spetgar la fin d’in silenzi. Sche la consola sa chatta en in auter "
"lieu, vegn ella numnada en la lingia da cumond dal kernel."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/release-notes/0-9-4-beta.md
msgid ""
"This is also what Ditana uses on itself. Every night the build host installs "
"the repository it has just built into a virtual machine, unattended, and the "
"packages are released only if the installed system boots and answers for "
"itself."
msgstr ""
"Quai è er quai che Ditana utilisescha per sasez. Mintga notg installescha il "
"host da build il repositori ch’el ha gist construì en ina maschina virtuala, "
"senza surveglianza, ed ils pachets vegnan publitgads mo sch’il sistem "
"installà vegn avià e respunda sez."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/release-notes/0-9-4-beta.md
msgid ""
"See [`docs/unattended-installation.md`](https://github.com/acrion/ditana-"
"installer/blob/main/docs/unattended-installation.md)."
msgstr ""
"Guardai [`docs/unattended-installation.md`](https://github.com/acrion/ditana-"
"installer/blob/main/docs/unattended-installation.md)."

#. type: Title ##
#: src/content/docs/release-notes/0-9-4-beta.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "ZFS on the installation medium"
msgstr "ZFS sin il medium d’installaziun"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/release-notes/0-9-4-beta.md
msgid ""
"The live medium booted a kernel lacking the ZFS module, causing a ZFS "
"installation to fail on hardware where it had previously succeeded. The ZFS "
"packages are now delivered via pacstrap and the initramfs is rebuilt "
"afterwards, and `zfsbootmenu` is added by the hook responsible for it rather "
"than through a second path that might conflict with it. The UEFI fallback "
"boot path was wrong and has been corrected."
msgstr ""
"Il medium live aviava in kernel senza il modul ZFS, uschia "
"ch’in’installaziun ZFS n’è betg reussida sin hardware, nua ch’ella aveva "
"funcziunà pli baud. Ils pachets ZFS vegnan uss furnids via pacstrap e "
"l’initramfs vegn reconstruì suenter, e `zfsbootmenu` vegn agiuntà dal hook "
"responsabel per quai empè da vegnir agiuntà sur ina segunda via che pudess "
"entrar en conflict cun quel. Il percurs d’aviar da reserva per UEFI era "
"fauss ed è vegnì curregì."

#. type: Title ##
#: src/content/docs/release-notes/0-9-4-beta.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Printing"
msgstr "Stampar"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/release-notes/0-9-4-beta.md
msgid ""
"Printer support is complete. mDNS is opened in firewalld and `avahi-daemon` "
"is enabled, so a network printer is discovered rather than typed in."
msgstr ""
"Il sustegn per stampaders è cumplet. mDNS è avert en firewalld ed `avahi-"
"daemon` è activà, uschia ch’in stampader da rait vegn chattà automaticamain "
"empè da stuair vegnir endatà a maun."

#. type: Title ##
#: src/content/docs/release-notes/0-9-4-beta.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Hardware"
msgstr "Hardware"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/release-notes/0-9-4-beta.md
msgid ""
"Firmware on some machines leaves the processor to remain in its shallowest "
"idle state after a suspend, which costs power for as long as the machine "
"stays up. Ditana now detects that and works around it."
msgstr ""
"Sin tschertas maschinas lascha la firmware il processur en ses stadi da "
"repaus il pli lev suenter ina suspensiun, quai che custa energia uschè ditg "
"che la maschina resta en funcziun. Ditana identifitgescha uss quai ed "
"evitescha il problem."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/release-notes/0-9-4-beta.md
msgid ""
"A new option binds ARP replies to the interface that received the request. "
"On a machine with more than one interface in the same subnet, the kernel "
"otherwise answers from whichever one it likes, which confuses switches and "
"some load-balancing setups."
msgstr ""
"Ina nova opziun collia las respostas ARP cun l’interfatscha che ha retschavì "
"la dumonda. Sin ina maschina cun pli ch’in’interfatscha en la medema rait "
"sectoriala respunda il kernel uschiglio da tge interfatscha ch’el vul, quai "
"che confunda switches e tschertas configuraziuns da repartiziun da la "
"chargia."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/release-notes/0-9-4-beta.md
msgid ""
"Graphics detection now inquires if the GPU is functional under Wayland "
"rather than whether it accelerates anything, which is the question the "
"desktop choices actually depend on."
msgstr ""
"L’identificaziun da la grafica examinescha uss sche la GPU funcziuna sut "
"Wayland, empè d’examinar sch’ella accelerescha insatge, quai ch’è la "
"dumonda, da la quala las tschernas dal desktop dependan effectivamain."

#. type: Title ##
#: src/content/docs/release-notes/0-9-4-beta.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Memory"
msgstr "Memoria"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/release-notes/0-9-4-beta.md
msgid ""
"Extended ZRAM Overcommit raises the virtual size of the compressed in-RAM "
"swap from 100% to 175% of physical RAM and the zstd effort from level 3 to "
"level 6, so a machine holds roughly 1.75 times its RAM in compressed form "
"before it touches the disk swap partition. Page-in latency remains the same, "
"because zstd decompresses at the same speed whatever the level cost. The "
"default stays unchanged."
msgstr ""
"Extended ZRAM Overcommit augmenta la grondezza virtuala dal swap cumprimì en "
"la RAM da 100 % a 175 % da la RAM fisica ed il sforz da zstd dal nivel 3 al "
"nivel 6, uschia ch’ina maschina tegna var 1,75 giadas sia RAM en furma "
"cumprimida, avant ch’ella tutga la partiziun swap sin il disc. La latenza da "
"page-in resta la medema, perquai che zstd ha la medema sveltezza tar la "
"decumpressiun, independentamain dal cust dal nivel. La valur da standard "
"resta nunmidada."

#. type: Title ##
#: src/content/docs/release-notes/0-9-4-beta.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The installation medium itself"
msgstr "Il medium d’installaziun sez"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/release-notes/0-9-4-beta.md
msgid ""
"The ISO is constructed using archiso 90. `b43-firmware` has been removed "
"from it: the package pulled the mainline kernel into the medium beside the "
"one Ditana boots. The build process has been made stricter – nothing copied "
"into the medium can now follow a symlink back into the live system, the "
"permissions of what is placed inside are declared rather than inherited, and "
"several gigabytes of intermediate files are stored on a disk instead of a "
"tmpfs."
msgstr ""
"L’ISO vegn construì cun archiso 90. `b43-firmware` è vegnì allontanà da "
"quel: il pachet tirava il kernel mainline en il medium sper il kernel che "
"Ditana aviescha. Il process da build è vegnì pli strict – nagut che vegn "
"copià en il medium na po uss pli suandar in symlink enavos en il sistem "
"live, las permissiuns da quai che vegn mess en il medium vegnan decleradas "
"empè d’esser ertadas, e plirs gigabytes da datotecas intermediaras vegnan "
"memorisads sin in disc empè d’in tmpfs."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/release-notes/0-9-4-beta.md
msgid ""
"What the medium carries is the versioned state and nothing more: a file that "
"lies in the working tree and that no rule of the repository declares stops a "
"signed build, since everything beneath the profile’s airootfs enters the "
"image. The installed system then records its origin, as `BUILD_ID` and "
"`VERSION_CODENAME` in `/usr/lib/os-release`: which medium built it, and "
"which configuration state that medium carried."
msgstr ""
"Il medium cuntegna il stadi registrà en la controlla da versiuns e nagut "
"auter: ina datoteca che sa chatta en l’ordinatur da lavur e che nagina regla "
"dal repositori na declera, ferma in build signà, perquai che tut quai che sa "
"chatta sut l’airootfs dal profil vegn en il maletg. Il sistem installà "
"registrescha lura ses origin, sco `BUILD_ID` e `VERSION_CODENAME` en `/usr/"
"lib/os-release`: tge medium che ha construì el e tge stadi da configuraziun "
"che quest medium cuntegneva."

#. type: Title ##
#: src/content/docs/release-notes/0-9-4-beta.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Builds you can check"
msgstr "Builds che Vus pudais controllar"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/release-notes/0-9-4-beta.md
msgid ""
"Every package Ditana ships is rebuilt from its upstream recipe, signed, and "
"published only as a complete set: if one package fails to build or its "
"sources cannot be verified, nothing is published at all. Since 0.9.3 that "
"process has become visible. Every run is recorded and made public, including "
"the runs that shipped nothing, and every package that was rebuilt links the "
"log of its own build."
msgstr ""
"Mintga pachet che Ditana furnescha vegn reconstruì a partir da ses recept "
"d’origin, signà e publitgà mo sco collecziun cumpletta: sch’in pachet na po "
"betg vegnir construì u sche sias funtaunas na pon betg vegnir verifitgadas, "
"na vegn insumma nagut publitgà. Dapi la versiun 0.9.3 è quest process "
"daventà visibel. Mintga execuziun vegn registrada e publitgada, inclusiv las "
"execuziuns che n’han furnì nagut, e mintga pachet ch’è vegnì reconstruì "
"cuntegna ina colliaziun al protocol da ses agen build."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/release-notes/0-9-4-beta.md
msgid ""
"Two things have been incorporated since. Every alteration introduced by an "
"upstream recipe is classified before anything is built, and anything that is "
"not safe by construction halts the whole run for a human to inspect – the "
"AUR has been under an active supply-chain attack, and Ditana rebuilds AUR "
"recipes into a repository its users trust via pacman’s signature "
"configuration. And a repository that builds and signs without issues can "
"still be one nobody can install from, so it is installed into a virtual "
"machine before it is released."
msgstr ""
"Dapi lura èn vegnidas agiuntadas duas chaussas. Mintga midada ch’in recept "
"d’origin introducescha vegn classifitgada avant che la construcziun cumenza, "
"e tut quai che n’è betg segir da princip ferma l’entira execuziun, per "
"ch’ina persuna examineschia la midada – l’AUR è stà la mira d’in’attatga "
"activa cunter la chadaina da furniziun, e Ditana reconstruescha recepts da "
"l’AUR en in repositori, dal qual las persunas che l’utiliseschan sa fidan "
"tras la configuraziun da signaturas da pacman. Ed in repositori che vegn "
"construì e signà senza problems po tuttina esser in repositori, dal qual "
"nagin na po installar; perquai vegn el installà en ina maschina virtuala, "
"avant ch’el vegn publitgà."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/release-notes/0-9-4-beta.md
msgid ""
"The pipeline that all of this relies on is now public as well. It is older "
"than Ditana: it began around 2023 as a single shell script and was never "
"intended for anyone else’s eyes. It is published because the claims the "
"build page makes are worth what their evidence is worth, and it is part of "
"the evidence. It is at [github.com/acrion/ditana-build](https://github.com/"
"acrion/ditana-build), and the runs it records are at [ditana.org/builds](/"
"builds/)."
msgstr ""
"La pipeline, sin la quala tut quai sa basa, è uss er publica. Ella è pli "
"veglia che Ditana: ella ha cumenzà enturn il 2023 sco in sulet script da "
"shell e n’era mai destinada als egls d’autras persunas. Ella vegn "
"publitgada, perquai che las affirmaziuns da la pagina dals builds valan quai "
"che lur cumprovas valan, ed ella fa part da las cumprovas. Ella sa chatta "
"sin [github.com/acrion/ditana-build](https://github.com/acrion/ditana-"
"build), e las execuziuns ch’ella registrescha sa chattan sin [ditana.org/"
"builds](/builds/)."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/release-notes/0-9-4-beta.md
msgid ""
"Packages are signed with a dedicated signing subkey instead of the primary "
"key. A subkey may be revoked and replaced independently, and it cannot "
"certify further keys. Nothing has to be done about this: the keyring "
"carrying it was shipped in August and has long since been picked up."
msgstr ""
"Ils pachets vegnan signads cun in’atgna clav secundara da signatura empè da "
"la clav principala. Ina clav secundara po vegnir revocada e remplazzada "
"separadamain, e na po betg certifitgar ulteriuras clavs. Nagut na sto vegnir "
"fatg: il portaclavs che cuntegna questa clav è vegnì furnì l’avust ed è gia "
"daditg vegnì installà."

#. type: Title ##
#: src/content/docs/release-notes/0-9-4-beta.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Upgrading from 0.9.3"
msgstr "Actualisar a partir da la versiun 0.9.3"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/release-notes/0-9-4-beta.md
msgid ""
"Installations created using the 0.9.3 medium continue to function, with a "
"single case that must be resolved manually. `bubblewrap-suid` no longer "
"exists, so the next system update replaces it, and Flatpak and Bubblejail "
"stop working on a machine where unprivileged user namespaces are disabled. "
"Brave and other AUR applications are unaffected."
msgstr ""
"Installaziuns ch’èn vegnidas creadas cun il medium da la versiun 0.9.3 "
"funcziunan vinavant, cun in sulet cas che sto vegnir schlià manualmain. "
"`bubblewrap-suid` n’exista betg pli, perquai remplazza la proxima "
"actualisaziun dal sistem quest pachet, e Flatpak e Bubblejail na funcziunan "
"betg pli sin ina maschina, nua ch’ils spazis da num da l’utilisader senza "
"privilegis èn deactivads. Brave ed autras applicaziuns da l’AUR n’èn betg "
"pertutgadas."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/release-notes/0-9-4-beta.md
msgid "The remedy is the guard described above:"
msgstr "Il remedi è il guardian descrit survart:"

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: src/content/docs/release-notes/0-9-4-beta.md
#: src/content/docs/troubleshooting/flatpak-and-bubblejail.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"sudo pacman -Syu ditana-userns-guard\n"
"echo /usr/bin/bwrap | sudo tee /etc/ditana/userns-allow.conf\n"
"sudo systemctl enable --now ditana-userns-guard.service\n"
msgstr ""
"sudo pacman -Syu ditana-userns-guard\n"
"echo /usr/bin/bwrap | sudo tee /etc/ditana/userns-allow.conf\n"
"sudo systemctl enable --now ditana-userns-guard.service\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/release-notes/0-9-4-beta.md
msgid ""
"One absolute path per line; `#` starts a comment. The service refuses to "
"raise the sysctl unless it has loaded and attached the program first, so a "
"machine on which it cannot run stays exactly as locked as it was."
msgstr ""
"In percurs absolut per lingia; `#` introducescha in commentari. Il servetsch "
"refusa d’augmentar il sysctl, sch’el n’ha betg l’emprim chargià e collià il "
"program, uschia ch’ina maschina, sin la quala el na po betg funcziunar, "
"resta exactamain uschè restrenschida sco ch’ella era."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/release-notes/0-9-4-beta.md
msgid ""
"An older medium cannot install at all any more. The installer fetches its "
"configuration when it runs, so a 0.9.3 USB stick reaches for packages its "
"own repository can no longer supply and stops. Write the current image to it."
msgstr ""
"In medium pli vegl na po insumma betg pli installar. L’installatur "
"telechargia sia configuraziun cura ch’el vegn exequì, uschia ch’in stick USB "
"da la versiun 0.9.3 tschertga pachets che ses agen repositori na po betg pli "
"furnir, e sa ferma. Scrivai il maletg actual sin il stick."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/release-notes/0-9-4-beta.md
msgid "A fresh installation from the 0.9.4 medium needs none of this."
msgstr ""
"Ina nova installaziun cun il medium da la versiun 0.9.4 na dovra nagut da "
"tut quai."
